---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Paper from "../../layouts/Paper.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
---

<Layout>
    <Paper title="What is human.">
        <div class="w-full text-center text-red-500">Work in progress.</div>

        <Header text="Preface" />
        <div>
            The human mind is a prediction machine, so is AI. When we build this
            technology to replicate the human mind, why does anything matters
            anymore?
        </div>

        <Header text="The open limitations" />
        <div>
            Context: ball parking, human takes in 1GB/s; AI takes in
            10MB/prompt, that is about 1M context tokens.
        </div>
        <div>
            Motivation: human is driven by natural selection, extended by what
            can be represented by Maslow’s hierachy of needs; what drives AI &
            why do we even need to support AI driven cause?
        </div>

        <Header text="The known capabilities" />
        <div>Pace: Inference speed is amazing. Training speed is amazing.</div>
        <div>Capacity: A lot more parameters, a lot more knowledge.</div>

        <Header text="Purpose" />
        <div>
            This paper focus on the placing out the arguments for these 2
            questions:
        </div>
        <div>
            - What happens for humanity when the open limitations are solved?
        </div>
        <div>- What happens while the open limitations are being solved?</div>
        <div>
            This paper does not meant to make any absolute statement about any
            matter discussed. All arguments or statements stated are personal
            opinions.
        </div>

        <Header text="Declaration of bias" />
        <div>
            I believe, or prompted to believe by my internal drive for survival,
            human is still, and must still, be at the wheel.
        </div>
        <div>At the point at writing, my position on the matter is:</div>
        <div>- AI will be more capable the anyone of us.</div>
        <div>
            - Human support human. Human is programmed to be social because
            humanity prosperity ultimatly benefit oneself. AI is not a part of
            the human species.
        </div>

        <Header text="Arguments" />
        <div class="w-full text-center">...to be continue...</div>
    </Paper>
</Layout>
